WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Quick add. Type a sentence like “Pay rent every 1st 9am p1 #Home” and Flow fills in the details.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: bills; errands.

3
00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:15.770
Open New task and just type a sentence.

4
00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:18.460
The preview shows what Flow understood: a monthly repeat at 9:00, P1, the project and a new tag.

5
00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:23.670
Create it — the saved title is just “Pay the hosting invoice”.

6
00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:29.670
A word was taken as a date: Choose Keep as typed, then set the date in the form. #name didn't pick my project: The project name must match; check the preview before creating.

7
00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:34.170
Dates, times and repeats from words
